## Handoff sessions

Work in this repository may be tracked as handoff sessions (see https://github.com/<owner>/session-handoff).

- Local sessions: `.sessions/<session>/`. Global sessions: `~/.sessions/<repo or group>/<session>/`.
- Before continuing tracked work, read the session's `HANDOFF.md`, `PLAN.md`, `TASKS.md`, `QUESTIONS.md` and `../_shared/`.
- `TASKS.md` and `QUESTIONS.md` hold open items only. Finished tasks are marked done in `PLAN.md`; answered questions move to Decisions in `HANDOFF.md`.
- Before ending substantial work, update those files and the session's line in `INDEX.md`.
- Never write secrets or personal data to these files.
